&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Millet bu vergi y&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;n altında ezilmiş, ezilmemiş, iktidarında b&amp;ouml;yle bir g&amp;uuml;ndemi olmadığını g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;yoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

