&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Normalde Sayın Mehmet Şimşek, ekonomi ile ilgili g&amp;uuml;zel tablolar &amp;ccedil;izerdi bu hafta g&amp;ouml;revi Cumhurbaşkanı Yardımcısı Sayın Cevdet Yılmaz aldı.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sayın Yılmaz, &amp;ldquo;Tahminlerimiz ger&amp;ccedil;ekleşirse, Avrupa&amp;rsquo;nın 4. B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k ekonomisi olacağız.&amp;rdquo; dedi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sayın Yılmaz!&amp;nbsp;&lt;a name=&quot;rwu59m5ozz7f&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;İki g&amp;uuml;n &amp;ouml;nce T&amp;Uuml;İK enflasyonu %32,87 olarak a&amp;ccedil;ıkladı! Ben size daha ilgin&amp;ccedil; rakamlar vereyim.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bazı kalemlerde Ekim 2025 itibariyle yıllık değişim oranlarını s&amp;ouml;yleyeyim: g&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ıda - %34,87&lt;/span&gt;, g&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;iyim - %50,06&lt;/span&gt;, k&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ira - %66,28&lt;/span&gt;, i&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;lk ve&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;o&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;rta&amp;ouml;ğretim&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;e&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ğitimi - %70,57&lt;/span&gt;, &amp;uuml;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;niversite - %64,58&lt;/span&gt;, u&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;laşım - %46,85.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu rakamlar, T&amp;Uuml;İK&amp;rsquo;in hesabına yanaşamıyor bile.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Asgari &amp;uuml;cretli bir aile bunlarla nasıl baş edecek?&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Emekli bir baba, evladını nasıl gelecek vaat edecek?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sayın Yılmaz&amp;rsquo;a buradan soruyorum. Bu rakamlarla, bu ger&amp;ccedil;eklerle biz hangi tahmine g&amp;ouml;re Avrupa&amp;rsquo;nın 4. B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k ekonomisi olacağız!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;hb7lwv41b5y1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_1x5mfy1fqdx7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;TAMAMLAYICI EMEKLİLİK Mİ, EK KESİNTİ Mİ?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;H&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;met &amp;ccedil;ıkıyor bir taraftan Avrupa&amp;rsquo;nın 4. b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k ekonomisi olacağız diyor diğer taraftan; &amp;ccedil;alışanların cebine uzanmaya devam ediyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;H&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;met bunun adınada &amp;ldquo;Tamamlayıcı Emeklilik Sigortası&amp;rdquo; diyor. Ama ger&amp;ccedil;ekte bu, iş&amp;ccedil;iden % 3 ek kesinti anlamına geliyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Asgari &amp;uuml;cretlinin maaşı bug&amp;uuml;n, bırakın tasarrufu, faturalarını bile &amp;ouml;demeye yetmiyor. Emekli olmuş milyonlar ge&amp;ccedil;inemiyor,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;ccedil;alışan milyonlar, a&amp;ccedil;lık sınırının altında bir maaşla hayata tutunmaya &amp;ccedil;alışıyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hal b&amp;ouml;yleyken, bir de &amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml;ne &amp;ldquo;tamamlayıcı emeklilik&amp;rdquo; adı altında yeni bir kesinti dayatılıyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_p9xbza30z7ju&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;SENDİKALAR MASADAN KALKIYOR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bakın, sendikalar masadan bir bir kalkıyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; ortada m&amp;uuml;zakere edilebilecek bir konu yok! Sayın Bakan sendikaları su&amp;ccedil;layarak, &amp;ldquo;somut teklif getirmediler&amp;rdquo; dese de, biz bunu samimi bulmuyoruz. Market rafları belli! Fatura tutarları belli! Kira rakamları belli! Enflasyonu az &amp;ouml;nce konuştuk. İş&amp;ccedil;inin ne istediğini bilmek i&amp;ccedil;in ne sendikaya gerek var ne de m&amp;uuml;neccim olmaya! İş&amp;ccedil;imiz, emek&amp;ccedil;imiz, insanca yaşayabileceği, kesintisiz, bahanesiz, bir &amp;uuml;cret talep ediyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_jtqvzr49aewg&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;B&amp;Uuml;T&amp;Ccedil;ENİN Y&amp;Uuml;K&amp;Uuml; DEĞİL, EMEĞİN G&amp;Uuml;C&amp;Uuml;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz, &amp;ldquo;emeği&amp;rdquo; b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;enin y&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml; olarak g&amp;ouml;ren bu anlayışı reddediyoruz. &amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; bu &amp;uuml;lkenin alın teriyle &amp;ccedil;alışanları, memurları, iş&amp;ccedil;ileri bu &amp;uuml;lkenin y&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml; değil, g&amp;uuml;c&amp;uuml;d&amp;uuml;r! İş&amp;ccedil;inin eline uzanmak kolay! Uzandığınız o el, bu &amp;uuml;lkenin fabrikalarında, tarlalarında, hastanelerinde, okullarında her g&amp;uuml;n alın teri d&amp;ouml;ken eldir. O eli ancak sıkmak gerekir!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz Saadet Partisi olarak, emeğin hakkını &amp;ldquo;alın teri kurumadan verecek&amp;rdquo; bir d&amp;uuml;zenin kurulması i&amp;ccedil;in m&amp;uuml;cadeleye devam edeceğiz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_t46b13fdlas6&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_rdhqpjy2ietc&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;B&amp;Uuml;T&amp;Ccedil;E İNDİKAT&amp;Ouml;RD&amp;Uuml;R!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar s&amp;ouml;zlerimi toparlıyorum. Malumunuz b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;e Maratonu başladı.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;e, bir iktidarın,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;tam olarak nerede durduğunu&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ne tarafa doğru y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;d&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ne yapmaya &amp;ccedil;alıştığını&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;kimlerle saf tutup&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;kimleri karşısına aldığını&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;g&amp;ouml;steren en net belgedir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz iktidarı;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Daha &amp;ouml;nce yaptığı b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;elerden tanıyor ve uyarıyoruz:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;enizdeki kalemler, artan ve derinleşen eşitsizlikleri gidermeye dair olsun.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;enizdeki kalemler farklı kimlikler ve k&amp;uuml;lt&amp;uuml;rler arasındaki kardeşliği tesise dair olsun.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;enizdeki kalemler haksızlıkları ve adaletsizlikleri giderip &amp;ccedil;oğulcu bir demokrasiye dair olsun.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bize; g&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; kurtarmaya dair kurnazlıklarla değil, toplumsal barışı ve huzuru inşa etmeye dair samimiyetle gelin!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_jakik4z52ht2&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;AMACIMIZ K&amp;Ouml;T&amp;Uuml;L&amp;Uuml;ĞE DAİR DURUM TESPİTİ YAPMAK DEĞİL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz b&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n bunları k&amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml;l&amp;uuml;ğe dair durum tespiti yapmak i&amp;ccedil;in değil&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;kendini zamana ve mek&amp;acirc;na karşı sorumlu hisseden herkesi&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;iyiliği y&amp;uuml;kseltmeye, hak ve adalet m&amp;uuml;cadelesini b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;tmeye davet etmek i&amp;ccedil;in s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Buradan herkese sesleniyorum!&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bu &amp;uuml;lkenin sorunlarını &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;zmek i&amp;ccedil;in,&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;bu &amp;uuml;lkeyi yaşanabilir bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye yapmak i&amp;ccedil;in;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ilk yapılması gereken, ahlakı &amp;ouml;ncelemektir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ahlakı kuşanmış kadrolar,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;haksız yere insanları, ekmeğinden, işinden ve &amp;ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;nden etmezler;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;tek bir insanın sa&amp;ccedil;ının telinin zarar g&amp;ouml;rmesini istemezler.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bizler, Saadet Partisi olarak; Selamı yaymak, acıları paylaşmak g&amp;uuml;zellikleri &amp;ccedil;oğaltmak barışı b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;tmek i&amp;ccedil;in &amp;ccedil;alışmaya devam edeceğiz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu vesileyle s&amp;ouml;zlerimi bitiriyor, hepinizi h&amp;uuml;rmet ve muhabbetle selamlıyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
